# Skymo - Master Rule Index

This monorepo contains all code for the Skymo game platform, including backend API, web frontend, background workers, and shared packages for logic, types, and utilities. All code is written in strict TypeScript and follows best practices for maintainability, security, and performance.

## Core & General

Fundamental project structure, setup, and general development guidelines.

| Rule File       | Description                                                                 |
| --------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| [task-list.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/task-list.mdc)  | How to create and maintain markdown task lists for project tracking         |
| [typescript.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/typescript.mdc) | Project-wide TypeScript usage and style guide                               |
| [core.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/packages/core.mdc)       | Details the core game logic, types, and validation used across the project. |

